From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rob Clark <robin.clark@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 08:26:43 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/dpu: Fix GAMMA LUT for sm8750 related DPUs

Add missing GC block.  Fixes GAMMA LUT on glymur/knp/etc.

Reported-by: Connor Abbott <cwabbott0@gmail.com>
Suggested-by: Dmitry Baryshkov <dmitry.baryshkov@oss.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Rob Clark <robin.clark@oss.qualcomm.com>
Reviewed-by: Dmitry Baryshkov <dmitry.baryshkov@oss.qualcomm.com>
Patchwork: https://patchwork.freedesktop.org/patch/757345/
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260930152645.22194-1-robin.clark@oss.qualcomm.com
Signed-off-by: Dmitry Baryshkov <dmitry.baryshkov@oss.qualcomm.com>
(cherry picked from commit 3389406e6a032b92c4770380c4aeec8dbf38cfae)
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_hw_catalog.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_hw_catalog.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_hw_catalog.c
index 08876005af01..256feb3f53f4 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_hw_catalog.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_hw_catalog.c
@@ -486,10 +486,11 @@ static const struct dpu_reg_dma_cfg sm8650_reg_dma = {
 	.version = 0x30000,
 };
 
-/* GC v2 on this DSPP is a LUT bus block too and is not wired up yet */
 static const struct dpu_dspp_sub_blks sm8750_dspp_sblk = {
 	.pcc = {.name = "pcc", .base = 0x1700,
 		.len = 0x90, .version = 0x60000},
+	.gc = {.name = "gc", .base = 0x17c0,
+		.len = 0x40, .version = 0x10008},
 	.igc = {.name = "igc", .base = 0x1260,
 		.len = 0x1c, .version = 0x50000},
 	.gamut = {.name = "gamut", .base = 0x1000,
-- 
2.56.0

